{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if the game itself is a reflection of your soul?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fire in the Dark&quot; is a psychological meta-horror where the eerie game on the heroine\u2019s computer and her room merge into one world, revealing each trauma through your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/extras/f1e2517cb384097a28f13a85977abd00.poster.avif?t=1756713236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/extras/f1e2517cb384097a28f13a85977abd00.webm?t=1756713236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/extras/f1e2517cb384097a28f13a85977abd00.mp4?t=1756713236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself locked in the girl\u2019s room, surrounded by personal items and hidden clues. A sinister game loads on her computer in which everything you do affects reality. Explore the dark forest, fight for survival by the campfire, and collect symbols from the heroine\u2019s past to gradually uncover her story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 1: The Lost Friend</strong> \u2013 a tale revealing one of the heroine\u2019s psychological traumas connected to her beloved dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 2: ???</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 3: ???</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter 4: ???</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Two intertwined worlds:</strong></i> the girl\u2019s real room and the grim computer game influence each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-horror:</strong> you will confront the heroine\u2019s traumas through the computer game, delving into her subconscious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Four facets of the soul:</strong></i> Knight, Elissa, Faceless, and the Witch personify the heroine\u2019s emotions and personality traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep puzzles:</strong> solving them requires thorough exploration of both worlds, as they are connected.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dive into the dark corners of the girl\u2019s mind and discover her harrowing fate!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441780?t=1756713236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/765c5d9767e43c1be572be13d22be7ede64877cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756713236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/755b3a5deba709cf8dbc00dbf2c4f743dd84012c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756713236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/755b3a5deba709cf8dbc00dbf2c4f743dd84012c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756713236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3462810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if the game itself is a reflection of your soul?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fire in the Dark&quot; is a psychological meta-horror where the eerie game on the heroine\u2019s computer and her room merge into one world, revealing each trauma through your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span