ess, and the Witch personify the heroine\u2019s emotions and personality traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep puzzles:</strong> solving them requires thorough exploration of both worlds, as they are connected.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dive into the dark corners of the girl\u2019s mind and discover her harrowing fate!</strong></i></p>","developers":["MirrorForge"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441780/0c104e65236056c3dd264737907d880a42838ebb/header.jpg?t=1756713236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 LTS (or an equivalent compatible distribution)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6300HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (or an equivalent compatible distribution)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5-1135G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0 Big Sur and newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5-6300